OL,3,GNEWSA'My nightclub was here before the
OL,4,Amoon landings - it's a rite of passage'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's the middle of the afternoon but
OL,7,Fthe queue of people outside Acapulco
OL,8,Fnightclub in Halifax are dressed for a
OL,9,Fnight out.
OL,11,FSparkly cowboy hats, high heels and
OL,12,Fbest shirts are donned, and toes are
OL,13,Falready tapping to the sound of the
OL,14,Fmusic leaking out from the doors of the
OL,15,Fvenue.
OL,17,FThey're are here for the club's monthly
OL,18,Fover-30s day disco, which starts at
OL,19,F15:30 BST and finishes by 20:00.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
