OL,3,GNEWSA'My nightclub was here before the
OL,4,Amoon landings - it's a rite of passage'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's like being out at night time, but
OL,7,Fit's in the day," clubber Pamela
OL,8,FHorsfall, 63, enthuses.
